Comment: 0,0:00:46.53,0:00:49.21,OP-CN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k38}装{\k38}作{\k38}成{\k38}熟{\k38}的{\k38}样{\k38}子
Comment: 0,0:00:55.42,0:00:56.79,OP-CN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k27}什{\k27}么{\k27}是{\k27}宝{\k27}物
Comment: 0,0:00:56.91,0:00:58.20,OP-CN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k16}什{\k16}么{\k16}是{\k16}喜{\k16}欢{\k16}的{\k16}事{\k16}情
Comment: 0,0:00:58.43,0:01:01.08,OP-CN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k24}总{\k24}要{\k24}失{\k24}去{\k24}过{\k24}后{\k24}才{\k24}会{\k24}发{\k24}觉{\k24}吧
Comment: 0,0:01:01.32,0:01:03.67,OP-CN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k18}可{\k18}能{\k18}就{\k18}在{\k18}那{\k18}司{\k18}空{\k18}见{\k18}惯{\k18}的{\k18}天{\k18}空{\k18}下
Comment: 0,0:01:03.81,0:01:07.01,OP-CN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k64}潜{\k64}藏{\k64}着{\k64}这{\k64}些
Comment: 0,0:01:07.73,0:01:09.78,OP-CN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k34}明{\k34}天{\k34}还{\k34}会{\k34}继{\k34}续
Comment: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:13.07,OP-CN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k38}在{\k38}蝴{\k38}蝶{\k38}上{\k38}系{\k38}上{\k38}缎{\k38}带
Comment: 0,0:01:13.69,0:01:15.53,OP-CN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k46}还{\k46}很{\k46}温{\k46}暖
Comment: 0,0:01:15.63,0:01:20.25,OP-CN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k77}少{\k77}女{\k77}看{\k77}到{\k77}的{\k77}梦
Comment: 0,0:01:24.86,0:01:26.32,OP-CN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k16}不{\k16}要{\k16}停{\k16}下{\k16} {\k16}一{\k16}直{\k16}向{\k16}前
Comment: 0,0:01:26.32,0:01:27.80,OP-CN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k16}朝{\k16}着{\k16}光{\k16}芒{\k16}的{\k16}方{\k16}向{\k16}前{\k16}进
Comment: 0,0:01:27.80,0:01:29.05,OP-CN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k20}我{\k20}们{\k20}无{\k20}法{\k20}回{\k20}头
Comment: 0,0:01:29.25,0:01:31.32,OP-CN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k13}握{\k13}紧{\k13}手{\k13} {\k13} {\k13}g{\k13}o{\k13}l{\k13}d{\k13}e{\k13}n{\k13} {\k13}r{\k13}a{\k13}y
Comment: 0,0:01:31.49,0:01:36.48,OP-CN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k45}还{\k45}在{\k45}你{\k45}身{\k45}边{\k45} {\k45}还{\k45}在{\k45}你{\k45}身{\k45}边
Comment: 0,0:01:36.65,0:01:38.17,OP-CN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k16}不{\k16}要{\k16}停{\k16}下{\k16} {\k16}一{\k16}直{\k16}向{\k16}前
Comment: 0,0:01:38.17,0:01:39.46,OP-CN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k14}朝{\k14}着{\k14}眺{\k14}望{\k14}的{\k14}方{\k14}向{\k14}前{\k14}进
Comment: 0,0:01:39.61,0:01:41.13,OP-CN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k21}我{\k21}们{\k21}做{\k21}出{\k21}了{\k21}选{\k21}择
Comment: 0,0:01:41.13,0:01:43.16,OP-CN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k14}仅{\k14}存{\k14}的{\k14} {\k14}g{\k14}o{\k14}l{\k14}d{\k14}e{\k14}n{\k14} {\k14}r{\k14}a{\k14}y
Comment: 0,0:01:43.33,0:01:50.04,OP-CN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k61}还{\k61}在{\k61}你{\k61}身{\k61}边{\k61} {\k61}还{\k61}在{\k61}你{\k61}身{\k61}边
